理得很好。\n海老紅油抄手是當日限定，4顆80元，其實就是蝦仁抄手，內餡有夠彈牙的，紅油則是下得不重，口味輕，整體還不錯。",null,[0,262]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2245022369665128010/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTWVZwWWJHRmlhMnQzVTI1Q1EyVnFVWGRPVlhNeFlXNXNhRnBYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2245022369665128010/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTWVZwWWJHRmlhMnQzVTI1Q1EyVnFVWGRPVlhNeFlXNXNhRnBYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2245022369665128010/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTWVZwWWJHRmlhMnQzVTI1Q1EyVnFVWGRPVlhNeFlXNXNhRnBYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2245022369665128010/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTWVZwWWJHRmlhMnQzVTI1Q1EyVnFVWGRPVlhNeFlXNXNhRnBYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2245022369665128010/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTWVZwWWJHRmlhMnQzVTI1Q1EyVnFVWGRPVlhNeFlXNXNhRnBYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2245022369665128010/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTWVZwWWJHRmlhMnQzVTI1Q1EyVnFVWGRPVlhNeFlXNXNhRnBYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,22409,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYVpYbGFia2t3U25CQ2VqUXdOVXMxYW5saFpXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x567be5597e8a9093!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnRaZXlabkkwSnBCejQwNUs1anlhZWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYVpYbGFia2t3U25CQ2VqUXdOVXMxYW5saFpXYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYVpYbGFia2t3U25CQ2VqUXdOVXMxYW5saFpXYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYVpYbGFia2t3U25CQ2VqUXdOVXMxYW5saFpXYxILMGRTclBDbFlqc1caPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uUmFaWGxhYmtrd1NuQkNlalF3TlVzMWFubGhaV2MSCzBkU3JQQ2xZanNXIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARk5CKflnle1YqCzBkU3JQQ2xZanNX\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",nul